  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.8.0: Major release with comprehensive observability and configuration enhancements. Added full OpenTelemetry integration with distributed tracing, metrics collection, and cloud-native monitoring support. Introduced extensive debug logging infrastructure with configurable levels and performance tracking. Enhanced statistics system with advanced tracking, execution counters, and runtime insights. New modern fluent configuration API with environment-aware settings, automatic preset detection, and JSON configuration support. Added type-constrained middleware for selective execution based on interface types. Enhanced notification system with automatic handler discovery alongside manual subscription patterns. Six new comprehensive sample projects demonstrating OpenTelemetry, configuration features, notification patterns, and type-constrained middleware. Complete documentation with dedicated guides for OpenTelemetry, statistics, logging, and configuration. Production-ready architecture patterns for modern cloud-native applications.",
